TL;DR
-------
CMake reads CMakeLists.txt, generates native build files for your platform,
you build with `cmake --build .`. Use add_executable / add_library for
targets, target_link_libraries to connect them, and target_include_directories
for headers. Keep builds out-of-source. Start simple, add complexity as
your project grows.
